<title>INDIA: India Raymond drops non-voting shr issue.</title>
<headline>India Raymond drops non-voting shr issue.</headline>
<dateline>BOMBAY 1996-09-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Indian textile and cement maker Raymond Ltd said on Monday it did not intend to move a proposed enabling resolution to issue non-voting shares at an extraordinary general meeting scheduled for October 11.</p>
<p>A company release did not give any reasons for the decision.</p>
<p>-- Bombay newsroom +91-22-265 9000</p>
</text>
